  "basicR": {
    "intro": "This two-day introductory workshop on R is designed to equip participants with foundational skills in R programming, data manipulation, and basic statistical analysis. On the first day, attendees will be introduced to the RStudio IDE, learn how to handle vectors and dataframes, and create basic graphs. The second day will focus on essential statistical techniques, including t-test, ANOVA, and linear regression, and conclude with an introduction to machine learning using the caret package tools. This hands-on workshop is ideal for beginners looking to build a solid base in R and explore its capabilities in data analysis and machine learning.",
